OL,3,ABurnham defends Jackdaw decision as
OL,4,ABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban on
OL,5,Anew oil and gas licences
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK government has approved
OL,8,Fproduction from the Jackdaw gas field
OL,9,Fin the North Sea amid intense debate
OL,10,Fabout the project's environmental and
OL,11,Feconomic impact.
OL,13,FMinisters said the first gas could be
OL,14,Fproduced by the end of this month,
OL,15,Fhelping heat millions of homes, and
OL,16,Falso announced the creation of a new
OL,17,Fenergy wealth fund.
OL,19,FBut environmental campaigners said the
OL,20,Fdecision would hamper efforts to tackle
OL,21,Fclimate change and make "no meaningful
OL,22,Fdifference" to UK energy security.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
