OL,3,APope does not need further treatment
OL,4,Aafter lung cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV does not need any further
OL,7,Ftreatment following an operation to
OL,8,Fremove a cancerous growth from his
OL,9,Flung, his doctors have said.
OL,11,FTest results on tissue removed during
OL,12,Fsurgery confirmed he had had a lung
OL,13,Fadenocarcinoma, as was initially
OL,14,Fdiagnosed, and that the disease was
OL,15,Flocalised, according to a statement
OL,16,Fshared by the Vatican.
OL,18,F"A subsequent oncological assessment
OL,19,Fhas confirmed that no further treatment
OL,20,Fis necessary," it added.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
