OL,3,APope does not need further treatment
OL,4,Aafter lung cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 71-year-old was discharged from
OL,7,FRome's Gemelli Hospital over the
OL,8,Fweekend four days after his operation -
OL,9,Fstopping to speak to well-wishers as he
OL,10,Fleft the grounds.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
